Protecting religious assembly in states of
HB0114
emergency act.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Smith, S and Senator(s) Hutchings
AN ACT relating to public health and safety; requiring rules enacted during
public health emergencies to provide exemptions for religious assembly as
specified; providing for enforcement and remedies; authorizing a cause of
action; providing exceptions to the Wyoming Governmental Claims Act; making
conforming amendments; and providing for an effective date.
1/3/2025 Bill Number Assigned
1/6/2025 H Received for Introduction
2/3/2025 H Did not Consider for Introduction